  "details": "I’d like a feature that lets me choose which status—green, blue, or orange—shows for each individual friend. Since Favorite Friends already lets me group my friends, could you build on that and assign statuses based on those groups? I often run into awkward situations when friends who spend long hours in VRChat—or those from other groups with whom I’m not compatible—join my instance. I’d rather avoid unfriending or blocking them, since that can carry risks.\n\nOn a separate note, it’s also frustrating that statuses don’t update in real time, forcing me to leave and re-enter the instance just to refresh them",
